 "result": "Call order (cookie is written after the view runs and after-request hooks):\n\n1. `Tessel.dispatch_request` (ending at `return self.finalize_request(ctx, rv)`) — `src/tessel/app.py:1019`\n2. `Tessel.finalize_request` — `src/tessel/app.py:1021`. Builds the response via `make_response`, then calls `finalize_reply`.\n3. `Tessel.finalize_reply` — `src/tessel/app.py:1394`. Runs the after-request functions, then, if the session isn't a null session, calls `persist_session` (`src/tessel/app.py:1416`).\n4. The session interface's `persist_session` — `src/tessel/sessions.py:337`. This is the cookie-session implementation; the abstract signature is at `sessions.py:263`.\n   - It calls `response.delete_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:356`) if the session was emptied.\n   - Otherwise it checks `cookie_needs_write` (`sessions.py:233`) and then calls `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`) with the signed session data.\n\n`src/tessel/testing.py:177` also calls `persist_session` directly, but that's the test client helper, not the normal request path.",
